{"Title":"An Act to set equal contracting conditions for electricity customers on basic service","BillNumber":"S2079","DocketNumber":"SD1498","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MJB0","Name":"Michael J. Barrett","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MJB0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T16:52:06.123"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MJB0","Name":"Michael J. Barrett","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MJB0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T16:52:06.1233333"},{"Id":"L_S1","Name":"Lindsay N. Sabadosa","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/L_S1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-31T11:35:54.11"},{"Id":"jml0","Name":"Jason M. Lewis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/jml0","ResponseDate":"2023-02-03T11:18:54.85"},{"Id":"MOM0","Name":"Michael O. Moore","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MOM0","ResponseDate":"2023-02-15T14:20:21.0833333"},{"Id":"JMC0","Name":"Joanne M. Comerford","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JMC0","ResponseDate":"2023-03-03T16:30:52.28"},{"Id":"JBE0","Name":"James B. Eldridge","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JBE0","ResponseDate":"2023-03-06T11:47:08.8833333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2079/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Barrett, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2079) of Michael J. Barrett, Lindsay N. Sabadosa, Jason M. Lewis, Michael O. Moore and other members of the General Court for legislation to set equal contracting conditions for electricity customers on basic service.  Telecommunications, Utilities and Energy.","DocumentText":"\tSection 1B of chapter 164 of the General Laws is hereby amended by striking out, in subsection (d), the words “for periods of up to six months” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- for the procurement period.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J37","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J37"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S30","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S30"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}